          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Q.1. Digit sum 14"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.145,
            0.602,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": "**a. Write other numbers whose digits add up to 14.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.171,
            0.638,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "**b. What is the smallest number whose digit sum is 14?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.198,
            0.685,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": "**c. What is the largest 5-digit number whose digit sum is 14?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.226,
            0.881,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "**d. How big a number can you form having the digit sum 14? Can you make an even bigger number?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.271,
            0.718,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. Some such numbers are:248, 653, 356, 815, 833, 12335, 23351."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.289,
            0.227,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": "b. 59"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.307,
            0.256,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "c. 95000"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.324,
            0.723,
            0.342
          ],
          "content": "d. 95, 9005, 900005, 90000005, 9000000005, 90000000000005"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.369,
            0.882,
            0.405
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Q.3. Calculate the digit sums of 3-digit numbers whose digits are consecutive (for example, 345). Do you see a pattern? Will this pattern continue?"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.415,
            0.337,
            0.432
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\nAns. 123 → 1+2+3 = 6\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
